        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe ŵasalile acalongo acimjakwe pamo ni liŵasa lyosope lya baba ŵawo kuti, “Tinjawule ngamsalile Mwenye jwa ku Iguputo kuti, ‘Acalongo acimjangu ni liŵasa lya baba ŵangu lyosope ŵatemiji ku Kenani, anguyiye une akuno.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵanduwo ali ŵakucinga, masengo gawo gakucinga yilangwa, ni ayice nayo soni yilangwa yawoyo pamo ni yipanje yawo yosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni pitamŵilanje ni kuja kumwusya kuti, ‘Ana masengo genu gali cici?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkajanje kuti, ‘Ŵamasengo ŵenuwe tuli ŵakucinga yilangwa kutandila tuli ŵacanandi mpela muŵaŵelele acibaba ŵetu.’ Mkajile myoyo kuti amkunde kuti mtameje mu Gosheni, ligongo Aiguputo akasiŵanyalapaga ŵandu ŵakucinga yilangwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
